.envrc
1password-credentials.json
CLAUDE.md

# OpenTofu
#
# terraform.tfstate IS committed on purpose -- it is encrypted at rest (see the
# `encryption` block in layer0/tofu/cluster/versions.tf) and holds the Talos PKI
# that makes the cluster reproducible. Everything below can leak plaintext, so
# it stays out.
.terraform/
*.tfplan
*.tfstate.backup
crash.log
crash.*.log
layer0/tofu/*/output/
